rob": 2.4702867789522243e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 56244, "start": 578.84, "end": 585.08, "text": " workstation this choice of application is so heavily deliberate like a local ai image generation", "tokens": [51185, 589, 19159, 341, 3922, 295, 3861, 307, 370, 10950, 30515, 411, 257, 2654, 9783, 3256, 5125, 51497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.03706977917597844, "compression_ratio": 1.735191637630662, "no_speech_prob": 2.4702867789522243e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 56244, "start": 585.08, "end": 591.0, "text": " environment is notoriously complex to manage you've got python source code yaml configuration files", "tokens": [51497, 2823, 307, 46772, 8994, 3997, 281, 3067, 291, 600, 658, 38797, 4009, 3089, 288, 335, 75, 11694, 7098, 51793], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.03706977917597844, "compression_ratio": 1.735191637630662, "no_speech_prob": 2.4702867789522243e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 59100, "start": 591.0, "end": 597.48, "text": " text-based prompt recipes massive dependency trees generated output images and crucially the neural", "tokens": [50365, 2487, 12, 6032, 12391, 13035, 5994, 33621, 5852, 10833, 5598, 5267, 293, 5140, 1909, 264, 18161, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.058599688343166076, "compression_ratio": 1.713310580204778, "no_speech_prob": 2.262444788805884e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 59100, "start": 597.48, "end": 603.72, "text": " network weights themselves the model checkpoints which can easily be like seven gigabytes each which", "tokens": [50689, 3209, 17443, 2969, 264, 2316, 1520, 20552, 597, 393, 3612, 312, 411, 3407, 42741, 1184, 597, 51001], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.058599688343166076, "compression_ratio": 1.713310580204778, "no_speech_prob": 2.262444788805884e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 59100, "start": 603.72, "end": 610.2, "text": " forces this really profound philosophical question what actually constitutes reproducible identity", "tokens": [51001, 5874, 341, 534, 14382, 25066, 1168, 437, 767, 44204, 114